>> a := Ahanoa hou.
>> b := Ahanoa hou.
>> c := a.
Huaputa tuhi: a wāhitau-pūmahara pūāhua ? 0, rārangi-hou.
Huaputa tuhi: a wāhitau-pūmahara pūāhua ? 1, rārangi-hou.
Huaputa tuhi: a wāhitau-pūmahara = b wāhitau-pūmahara, rārangi-hou.
Huaputa tuhi: a wāhitau-pūmahara = c wāhitau-pūmahara, rārangi-hou.
